<title>UK: Baltic Handy Index rose 2 points to 1,081.</title>
<headline>Baltic Handy Index rose 2 points to 1,081.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Handy Index for Handy size shipping rates rose to 1,081 on Thursday from 1,079 on Feb 25, with the base being Jan 7 1997 equals 1000. The BHI is based on the following routes with rates in dollars/tonne.</p>
<p> Route					 Weighting   Average   Prev</p>
<p>								   ($/Day)</p>
<p>1. Continent/Far East			 25 pct    12,675  12,667</p>
<p>2. Japan-S.Korea/NoPac or Australia RV  30	   9,275   9,250</p>
</text>
